   "maxH": 900,
   "text": "How you get here and what happens next\n\n1. Where it opens from: on any playground choose More (the three dots at the end of a library row, or the top right of the workspace), then Save as template…\n\n2. This sheet appears over the playground you were looking at. Fill in the name and description and tick the files to include. Dependencies, build output and files that may hold secrets are unticked by default.\n\n3. After Save template the sheet closes, you are back in the playground, and a notice says Saved as template.\n\n4. Next time you create a playground, it is listed under Mine in the template picker.",
